cham3-base for Debian
---------------------

This is the M0 development skeleton of the cham3-base package. Its only
purpose is to validate Debian packaging and live image integration for the
M0 (repository and build baseline) milestone.

It installs no services, no security policy, no enforcement components and no
system configuration. It does not provide application isolation, permission
contracts or network controls. A system with this package installed is not a
cham3 system.

The package metadata (maintainer address, license selection) contains
placeholders that require owner decisions before any public release.
